<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<!--
  v03 数据瀑布 · slide-bullets
  视觉语言：深底 + 金色脊柱 + 标题（金色渐变）+ 每条要点像数据瀑布那样从屏顶弹性坠落 + 金色拖尾
  版式：顶部标签 + 中部金渐变标题（带金线下划）+ 卡片列表（每项配金边框、序号金圆、左金竖线）
  动画时间轴：
    t=0.0s   背景立即可见，顶部金光条 + 中央脊柱呼吸
    t=0.2s   KEY POINTS 顶部标签 + corner 注脚淡入
    t=0.5s   {{title}} 金色标题从底部上浮，金线下划
    t=1.4s   第 1 条要点 li 从屏顶弹性坠入（带模糊→清晰、长拖尾）
    t=1.9s   第 2 条要点坠入
    t=2.4s   第 3 条要点坠入
    t=2.9s   第 4 条要点坠入
    t=3.4s   第 5 条要点坠入（若有）
    t=3.9s   第 6 条要点坠入（若有）
    t=4.6s   底部"微域生光"脚标渐显
    t=4.6–18s 全部元素定格，金色脊柱呼吸 idle
-->
<title>slide-bullets · v03</title>
<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body {
    width: 1080px;
    height: 1920px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #080808;
    font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'PingFang SC', SimHei, sans-serif;
    color: #fff;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  .stage {
    position: relative;
    width: 1080px;
    height: 1920px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 800px 1100px at 50% 50%, rgba(201,162,39,0.10) 0%, transparent 65%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 600px 400px at 50% 8%, rgba(232,196,107,0.20) 0%, transparent 70%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #0a0a0a 0%, #080808 60%, #050505 100%);
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 88px 76px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .top-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 6px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, #d4af37 20%, #e8c46b 50%, #d4af37 80%, transparent 100%);
    box-shadow: 0 0 24px #c9a227, 0 0 48px rgba(201,162,39,0.4);
  }

  .spine {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%; top: 80px;
    width: 2px; height: 1760px;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(212,175,55,0.0) 5%,
      rgba(212,175,55,0.28) 50%,
      rgba(212,175,55,0.0) 95%,
      transparent 100%);
    animation: spineBreath 3s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    z-index: 0;
  }
  @keyframes spineBreath {
    0%   { opacity: 0.3; }
    100% { opacity: 0.75; }
  }

  .grid-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(212,175,55,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(212,175,55,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 120px 120px;
    mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 800px 1300px at 50% 50%, #000 30%, transparent 80%);
    -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 800px 1300px at 50% 50%, #000 30%, transparent 80%);
    z-index: 0;
  }

  /* 顶部 section 标签 */
  .section-tag {
    font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.4em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #c9a227;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeIn 0.5s ease 0.2s forwards;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  /* 标题块 */
  .title-block {
    margin-top: 36px;
    padding-left: 24px;
    border-left: 4px solid #c9a227;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(40px);
    animation: slideUp 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1) 0.5s forwards;
  }
  @keyframes slideUp {
    0%   { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(40px); }
    100% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }
  .slide-title {
    font-size: 64px;
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.18;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f4d97a 0%, #e8c46b 40%, #c9a227 70%, #9b7b1f 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
    text-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(232,196,107,0.2);
  }

  /* 金线分隔 */
  .divider {
    height: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, #f0d060, #c9a227, rgba(201,162,39,0.12));
    background-size: 200% 100%;
    border-radius: 1px;
    margin: 32px 0 40px;
    transform: scaleX(0);
    transform-origin: left center;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    animation:
      lineGrow 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1) 0.9s forwards,
      shimmer 3s linear 1.6s infinite;
  }
  @keyframes lineGrow {
    0%   { transform: scaleX(0); }
    100% { transform: scaleX(1); }
  }
  @keyframes shimmer {
    from { background-position: 200% 0; }
    to   { background-position: -200% 0; }
  }

  /* Bullets 列表 */
  .bullets-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 22px;
    flex: 1;
    counter-reset: bullet-counter;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  /* 每条 li 是一次"数据瀑布坠落" */
  .bullets-list .stagger-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 22px;
    padding: 28px 32px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(201,162,39,0.32);
    border-radius: 14px;
    font-size: 38px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
    position: relative;
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(-700px);
    filter: blur(8px);
    animation: bulletDrop 1.0s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.4, 1) both;
    will-change: transform, opacity, filter;
  }
  @keyframes bulletDrop {
    0%   { transform: translateY(-700px); opacity: 0; filter: blur(8px); }
    70%  { filter: blur(0); }
    100% { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; filter: blur(0); }
  }

  /* 左侧金竖线 */
  .bullets-list .stagger-item::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0; top: 18px; bottom: 18px;
    width: 3px;
    border-radius: 0 2px 2px 0;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #f0d060, #c9a227, rgba(201,162,39,0.3));
  }

  /* 序号金圆 */
  .bullets-list .stagger-item::before {
    counter-increment: bullet-counter;
    content: counter(bullet-counter);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 42px; height: 42px;
    min-width: 42px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(201,162,39,0.12);
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(201,162,39,0.6);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700;
    color: #e8c46b;
    margin-top: 4px;
    box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(201,162,39,0.3);
  }

  /* 入场 stagger 延迟（每条 0.5s 间隔，留出坠落感） */
  .bullets-list .stagger-item:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 1.4s; }
  .bullets-list .stagger-item:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 1.9s; }
  .bullets-list .stagger-item:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 2.4s; }
  .bullets-list .stagger-item:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 2.9s; }
  .bullets-list .stagger-item:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 3.4s; }
  .bullets-list .stagger-item:nth-child(6) { animation-delay: 3.9s; }

  /* 每条 li 顶部小段拖尾，再用伪光线 */
  .bullets-list .stagger-item .trail {
    /* 占位：通过 stagger-item::before 顶部不便加拖尾，
       改用单独的浮动金粒子（侧栏装饰）来强化"瀑布感"，见下方 .side-drop */
  }

  /* 侧栏装饰金粒子（在 li 入场时同步坠落，模拟瀑布拖尾） */
  .side-drop {
    position: absolute;
    width: 12px; height: 12px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, #f4d97a 0%, #c9a227 60%, transparent 100%);
    box-shadow: 0 0 14px #c9a227, 0 0 28px rgba(232,196,107,0.45);
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(-600px);
    animation: sideDrop 1.0s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.4, 1) forwards;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  @keyframes sideDrop {
    0%   { transform: translateY(-600px); opacity: 0; }
    70%  { opacity: 0.9; }
    100% { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 0.7; }
  }
  .side-drop::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%; bottom: 100%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 2px; height: 320px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, rgba(232,196,107,0.7) 100%);
    opacity: 0;
    animation: sideTail 1.0s ease forwards;
  }
  @keyframes sideTail {
    0%   { opacity: 0; }
    40%  { opacity: 0.85; }
    100% { opacity: 0; }
  }
  .sd1 { top: 880px;  left: 32px;  animation-delay: 1.3s; }
  .sd1::before { animation-delay: 1.3s; }
  .sd2 { top: 1020px; right: 32px; animation-delay: 1.8s; }
  .sd2::before { animation-delay: 1.8s; }
  .sd3 { top: 1180px; left: 32px;  animation-delay: 2.3s; }
  .sd3::before { animation-delay: 2.3s; }
  .sd4 { top: 1340px; right: 32px; animation-delay: 2.8s; }
  .sd4::before { animation-delay: 2.8s; }

  /* corner 角标 */
  .corner {
    position: absolute;
    font-size: 16px;
    letter-spacing: 6px;
    color: rgba(232,196,107,0.45);
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeIn 0.7s ease 0.3s forwards;
    z-index: 3;
  }
  .corner.tr { top: 100px; right: 76px; }
  .corner.br { bottom: 100px; right: 76px; }

  /* 底部品牌 */
  .brand-footer {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px;
    margin-top: 44px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeIn 0.6s ease 4.6s forwards;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }
  .brand-w {
    font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 46px; font-weight: 700;
    color: #c9a227; line-height: 1;
    text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(201,162,39,0.45);
  }
  .brand-name {
    font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'PingFang SC', SimHei, sans-serif;
    font-size: 28px; font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 10px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
  }

  @keyframes fadeIn {
    0%   { opacity: 0; }
    100% { opacity: 1; }
  }

  .bottom-glow {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, #c9a227 30%, #c9a227 70%, transparent 100%);
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeIn 0.7s ease 4.6s forwards;
  }

  .duration-debug {
    position: absolute; bottom: 14px; right: 22px; z-index: 99;
    font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 10px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="stage">
  <div class="top-glow"></div>
  <div class="grid-bg"></div>
  <div class="spine"></div>

  <div class="corner tr">KEY POINTS</div>
  <div class="corner br">{{index}} / SERIES</div>

  <!-- 侧栏装饰金粒子（与 li 同步坠落） -->
  <div class="side-drop sd1"></div>
  <div class="side-drop sd2"></div>
  <div class="side-drop sd3"></div>
  <div class="side-drop sd4"></div>

  <div class="section-tag">要点 · KEY POINTS</div>

  <div class="title-block">
    <div class="slide-title">{{title}}</div>
  </div>

  <div class="divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <!--
    {{bullets_html}} 由 Python 渲染时注入，格式：<li class="stagger-item">内容</li>
    本模板提供外层 <ul> 容器，stagger 通过 nth-child 实现。
  -->
  <ul class="bullets-list">
    {{bullets_html}}
  </ul>

  <div class="brand-footer">
    <span class="brand-w">W</span>
    <span class="brand-name">微域生光</span>
  </div>

  <div class="bottom-glow"></div>
  <div class="duration-debug">{{DURATION_MS}}ms · slide-{{index}} · {{slide_type}}</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
